class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Love Actually in Concert</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2025-05-23T10:00:00+01:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 23 May 2025 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2025-05-23T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/artist/love-actually-in-concert/love-actually-in-concert-3901391/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2025-05-23T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/artist/love-actually-in-concert/love-actually-in-concert-3901391/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"#information-section\" target=\"_self\">More information</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"LA London 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p><strong>Age restriction: 15+ only</strong></p>\n<p>This Christmas, Love Actually, perhaps one of the most quotable and adored Christmas films of all time, will be presented live in concert, with a full orchestra playing its score live-to-film.</p>\n<p>Love Actually In Concert has become an annual festive tradition for many, gathering numerous sold out audiences in previous years.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LA_London_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"LA London 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Love Actually in Concert</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors \">Doors</div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>December 6th 2025</div>\n                <div>Matinee</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">13:30</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>December 6th 2025</div>\n                <div>Evening</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">18:30</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n              \n                      </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n              <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"py-md\">\n  <h2 class=\"variable-color\">Get pre-sale access by signing up to our newsletter</h2>\n    <div class=\"event-signup-content__form-wrapper mt-md\">\n    <div id=\"prepform\" class=\"accord-form\"></div>\n    <script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={2C975A98-C100-0F41-E92D-5A0BB8CB9FBB}\"></script>\n  </div>\n  </div>  </div>      \n      \n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"newsletter-modal fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full outline-none z-50\" id=\"newsletterModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__click-break\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__inner bg-white modal-dialog relative w-auto\">\n\n\t\t\n    <div class=\"newsletter-modal__close\">\n      <button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"54\" height=\"54\" viewBox=\"0 0 54 54\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect x=\"12.7285\" y=\"39.5977\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-45 12.7285 39.5977)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n<rect x=\"39.5977\" y=\"41.0117\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-135 39.5977 41.0117)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t</button>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__body newsletter-modal__body--modal-app\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe src=\"/newsletter-modal-content\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"logo-slider bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"logo-slider__wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"slider\">\n      <div class=\"slide-track ticker-left-to-right sm:flex sm:items-center sm:content-center bg-white\">\n                                  <div class=\"logo-slider__item slide\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n            <img class=\"\"\n  src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.