vg>\n      </a>\n                        \n                              <a aria-label=\"Visit our Tiktok page\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@eventimapollo\" target=\"blank\">\n        <svg class=\"social-icon social-links__icon\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M20 0C8.95 0 0 8.95 0 20C0 31.05 8.95 40 20 40C31.05 40 40 31.05 40 20C40 8.95 31.05 0 20 0ZM24.65 14.6V15.24V23.89C24.65 25.95 23.84 27.91 22.38 29.37C20.92 30.83 18.96 31.64 16.9 31.64C14.84 31.64 12.88 30.83 11.42 29.37C9.96 27.91 9.15 25.95 9.15 23.89C9.15 21.83 9.96 19.87 11.42 18.41C12.88 16.95 14.84 16.14 16.9 16.14H18.34V20.22H16.9C15.92 20.22 14.99 20.6 14.3 21.3C13.61 21.99 13.22 22.92 13.22 23.9C13.22 24.88 13.6 25.81 14.3 26.5C14.99 27.19 15.92 27.58 16.9 27.58C17.88 27.58 18.81 27.19 19.5 26.5C20.19 25.81 20.58 24.88 20.58 23.91V8.36H24.64L24.84 8.74C25.47 9.91 26.32 11.02 27.38 11.84C28.2 12.47 29.12 12.92 30.14 13.1L30.86 13.23L30.08 17.16L29.39 17.04C28.56 16.89 27.75 16.64 26.99 16.28C26.12 15.87 25.31 15.31 24.65 14.61V14.6Z\" fill=\"#142E4C\"/>\n</svg>\n      </a>\n          </p>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<!-- // Off-Canvas (Burger Menu) Navigation END -->\n\n<div class=\"off-canvas__click-block\"></div>\n\n\n  <main id=\"main\" class=\"page-home\" data-page-handle=\"events\">\n\n    <div class=\"bg-white pb-[8rem] md:pb-[10rem]\">\n      \n    \n    \n<div class=\"event-hero bg-eventim-navy\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 md:gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-7\">\n                          <p class=\"date variable-color\">Wednesday 21st January 2026</p>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Whiplash in Concert</h1>\n        \n\n                                \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                                    <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/whiplash-in-concert-eventim-apollo-20657294/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"#information-section\" target=\"_self\">More information</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"Whiplash 1080x1080 EN\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>Relive the 2014 Oscar-winning® film Whiplash, starring Miles Teller and JK Simmons, written and directed by Damien Chazelle, during a mesmerizing live concert experience on January 21, 2026 at Eventim Apollo in London.</p>\n<p>Whiplash tells the story of an ambitious young drummer, Andrew, studying at an elite jazz conservatory in New York City, and his ruthless instructor, Fletcher, who pushes Andrew to the brink in the pursuit of greatness.</p>\n<p>The show features a 18-piece London Intercollegiate Jazz Orchestra (LIJO) led by Finn Genockey and conducted by composer Justin Hurwitz, and features world-class drummer Greyson Nekrutman. Let yourself be carried away by the incredible music and thrilling drum solos performed in perfect synchronisation with the film projected on the big screen.</p>\n<p>Like the film’s protagonist, the drummer will have the difficult task of following every movement of the conductor with total precision, capturing the intensity of the film in a live concert experience.</p>\n<p><strong>Doors open at 7pm<br />Show Starts at 8pm</strong></p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/whiplash_1080x1080_EN.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"Whiplash 1080x1080 EN\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Whiplash in Concert</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors \">Doors</div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>January 21st 2026</div>\n                <div>Evening</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">19:00</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n              \n                      </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n      \n      \n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"newsletter-modal fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full outline-none z-50\" id=\"newsletterModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__click-break\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__inner bg-white modal-dialog relative w-auto\"