                        <p class=\"date variable-color\">Saturday 24th October 2026</p>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Jeff Wayne’s Musical Version of The War of The Worlds</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2025-11-28T12:00:00+00:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 28 Nov 2025 AT 12:00pm</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2025-11-28T12:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/jeff-wayne-eventim-apollo-20991466/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2025-11-28T12:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/jeff-wayne-eventim-apollo-20991466/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/lounge-pass-upgrade-eventim-apollo-20991467/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>KILIMANJARO LIVE presents: Jeff Wayne’s Musical Version of The War of The Worlds LIVE! THE CONCERT EXPERIENCE</p>\n<p>Hot on the heels of its hugely successful 2025 UK arenas tour, the iconic Jeff Wayne musical masterpiece is back with <strong>Jeff Wayne’s Musical Version of The War of The Worlds LIVE! THE CONCERT EXPERIENCE.</strong> For the first time ever, the incredible The War of the Worlds original double-album, which spent a record breaking 330 weeks in the UK charts on original release, will be brought to life through a full 15-date UK theatre tour, throughout October 2026. The Live Concert Experience (steered by, but not starring, Jeff Wayne), will immerse audiences into the musical craftmanship of the original double-album. Stripped back from the show-stopping big stars and giant Martian fighting machines of previous The War of The Worlds tours, the 2026 theatre tour brings it all back to where it began – the music, of the original 1970s chart-busting double-album, in the live format.<br /><br />Where previous live The War of the Worlds tour have brought stars of stage and screen to re-enact HG Wells' gripping tale of Martian invasion, the new 2026 theatre tour instead brings the full double-album to life through a concert experience of live artists, band, orchestra and video. A complete live double- album encounter, the 2026 Concert Experience gets closer to the music than ever before, immersing the audience into the musical mind of its creator, Jeff Wayne; who has hand-curated and produced this tour.</p>\n<p>As one of the longest running albums in chart history, Jeff Wayne’s Musical Version of The War of the Worlds LIVE! The Concert Experience is a rare opportunity for The War of the Worlds fans to delight in the full double-album in the live format, brought to its full musical potential through a live orchestra, band and artists. This is one invasion not to be missed, ULLA!</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/1080x1080_2025-11-24-131523_wbxz.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors \">Doors</div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>October 24th 2026</div>\n                <div>Evening</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">19:00</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n              \n                      </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n              <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"py-md\">\n  <h2 class=\"variable-color\">Get pre-sale access by signing up to our newsletter</h2>\n    <div class=\"event-signup-content__form-wrapper mt-md\">\n    <div id=\"prepform\" class=\"accord-form\"></div>\n    <script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={2C975A98-C100-0F41-E92D-5A0BB8CB9FBB}\"></script>\n  </div>\n  </di