\"2025-11-21T09:00:00+00:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 21 Nov 2025 AT 9:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2025-11-21T09:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/the-witcher-in-concert-eventim-apollo-20946637/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2025-11-21T09:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/the-witcher-in-concert-eventim-apollo-20946637/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/lounge-pass-upgrade-eventim-apollo-20946638/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"The Witcher 1x1\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>The Witcher in Concert returns to Eventim Apollo in October 2026.</p>\n<p>The Witcher in Concert, which celebrates 10 years of The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, brings to life the open-world role-playing game’s timeless score with cutting-edge visuals and music specially arranged for the occasion under the supervision of The Witcher 3 co-composer Marcin Przybyłowicz. The tracks are performed by a 14-member ensemble orchestra including Percival Schuttenbach — co-composers of the game’s soundtrack well known for their contributions to several iconic tracks.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/The_Witcher_1x1.jpg?width=768&a